{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2020-01", "window": 2, "start_date": 1578441600, "end_date": 1579132799, "month_true_total": 2948, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:59:56 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "61908792", "author": {"steamid": "76561198154725479", "personaname": "TayK-47", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/TayScribbles/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 28489, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 25784, "last_played": 1614373936, "avatar": "36f6923d41a938b6882c7e685e84f50898b398f9"}, "language": "english", "review": "Free to play with a dev team that actively updates the game, adds tons of new content, is funny, and cares? A rarity, a gem, a must have", "timestamp_created": 1579132298, "timestamp_updated": 1579132298, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "61908633", "author": {"steamid": "76561198220862912", "personaname": "EvilDivinity", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198220862912/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 153661, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 60544, "last_played": 1787379205, "avatar": "804dd7d9d3cdf93874b79ae69a5b0bf95da262c1"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you want to dedicate alot of time to something with alot of cool things to grind for or you have cash to blow try this game. The community is fine just stick to your clan and region chat and be nice.\nI posted entire self made sexy fanfics in region chat for days without anyone getting on my case so just try to stay away from anything triggering and you will be fine in region chat.\nYou can just play this game off and on again and make slow and steady progress that speeds up when you hit a goal you set or use a discount that comes from logging in every now and then to buy some plat and speed the game up and get stuff you want faster.\nI dont recommend getting into this game if you dont like to learn controls and wiki what you can do and how to do it. Region will almost always have someone to answer your questions.\nJust relax and enjoy because their is no real endgame and instead the journey is what you play for.\nIf you want jolts of joy from getting cool stuff or satisfaction from making powerful builds and using them AND you can learn to not stress over the grind then give it a real shot watch videos to learn what not to waste time and money on.", "timestamp_created": 1579131977, "timestamp_updated": 1579131977, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "61908281", "author": {"steamid": "76561198799424865", "personaname": "red menace", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198799424865/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 31007, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17605, "last_played": 1785706179, "avatar": "4f6c32ca1e5b6d3c6d4e0391eff05ecc349ce97a"}, "language": "english", "review": "yes", "timestamp_created": 1579131174, "timestamp_updated": 1579131174, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}, {"recomm